msgstr "当前为私密草稿页面预览，发布网站需要另行确认。"

msgid "Site navigation"
msgstr "网站导航"

msgid "Create separate pages for author guidelines, editorial boards, policies and other topics."
msgstr "为投稿指南、编委会、政策等主题创建独立页面。"

