msgstr "当前原型最多支持 20 个页面。更改页面网址标识后，旧链接将在发布后失效。"

msgid "Enable AI independent-page suggestions"
msgstr "启用 AI 独立页面建议"

msgid "Image above text"
msgstr "图片位于正文上方"

msgid "Image to the left"
msgstr "图片位于左侧"

msgid "Image to the right"
msgstr "图片位于右侧"

msgid "Customise this page's design"
msgstr "自定义此页面设计"

msgid "Choose a layout"
msgstr "选择页面布局"

msgid "Content width (%)"
msgstr "内容宽度（%）"

msgid "Page background colour"
msgstr "页面背景颜色"

msgid "Page accent colour"
msgstr "页面强调颜色"

msgid "Page text alignment"
msgstr "页面文字对齐方式"

msgid "Choose alignment"
msgstr "选择对齐方式"

msgid "Reload the page editor before changing a styled page."
msgstr "请重新加载页面编辑器，再修改已有独立设计的页面。"

msgid "Complete every custom page design setting."
msgstr "请完整填写页面自定义设计设置。"

msgid "Page-specific design"
msgstr "独立页面设计"

msgid "Leave unchecked to inherit the site design. Enter any six-digit hexadecimal colours when customising."
msgstr "不勾选时沿用网站设计；自定义时可输入任意六位十六进制颜色。"

msgid "Suggested page title"
msgstr "建议的页面标题"

msgid "Suggested page text"
msgstr "建议的页面正文"

msgid "AI page suggestions"
msgstr "AI 页面建议"

msgid "Back to independent pages"
msgstr "返回独立页面"

msgid "Request status"
msgstr "请求状态"

msgid "The AI service did not return usable suggestions. Try a new request if appropriate."
msgstr "AI 服务未返回可用建议；如有需要，请发起新请求。"

msgid "This request was cancelled before sending because authorisation changed."
msgstr "授权状态发生变化，请求在发送前已取消。"

msgid "This request is still being processed."
msgstr "该请求仍在处理中。"

msgid "AI may invent or misstate facts. Check every statement, especially policies, names, indexing, fees and dates. Applying replaces this page's draft title, body and page-specific design; it preserves its URL, image and visibility. Publishing requires a separate confirmation."
msgstr "AI 可能编造或错误陈述事实。请逐项核查，尤其是政策、名称、收录、费用和日期。应用建议将替换本页面草稿的标题、正文和独立页面设计，但保留网址、图片及显示状态；发布仍需另行确认。"

msgid "Current saved page"
msgstr "当前已保存页面"

msgid "Edit this suggestion and preview your changes before applying."
msgstr "可修改这份建议，并在应用前预览修改效果。"

msgid "Preview original suggestion"
msgstr "预览原始建议"

msgid "Preview edited suggestion"
msgstr "预览修改后的建议"

msgid "Replace this draft page's title, text and design with this suggestion."
msgstr "使用此建议替换页面草稿的标题、正文和设计。"

msgid "Private AI suggestion preview. Review all generated statements; this suggestion has not been applied or published."
msgstr "这是私密 AI 建议预览。请核查所有生成内容；该建议尚未应用或发布。"

msgid "Apply this reviewed preview to the draft page."
msgstr "将已审核的预览应用到页面草稿。"

msgid "This request identifier belongs to a different AI task or page."
msgstr "该请求编号已用于其他 AI 任务或页面。"

msgid "Provide a fictional page brief of at most 800 characters."
msgstr "请填写不超过 800 字符的虚构页面需求。"

msgid "AI page suggestions are not enabled for this site and test environment."
msgstr "本网站或测试环境尚未启用 AI 页面建议。"

msgid "The site's local AI request limit has been reached."
msgstr "本网站的本地 AI 测试请求次数已达上限。"

msgid "AI page suggestion applied to the draft. Review and edit it before publishing."
msgstr "AI 页面建议已应用到草稿，发布前请继续审核和编辑。"

msgid "Create pages such as About, Author Guidelines, Editorial Board or Policies, or choose your own titles. Pages inherit the site design unless customised."
msgstr "可创建介绍、投稿指南、编委会、政策等页面，也可自拟标题。未自定义的页面沿用网站设计。"

msgid "Choose a saved page and describe its purpose and the style you want. AI can suggest editable titles, text and design settings."
msgstr "选择已保存的页面，描述用途和期望风格；AI 可以提出可编辑的标题、正文和设计设置。"

msgid "Only your brief, whether the page has an image, and the site type are sent to OpenAI. Existing page text, names, image bytes and manuscripts are not sent automatically. Use fictional information only. API use may incur charges and provider retention may apply; generated suggestions are stored in this test database."
msgstr "系统仅向 OpenAI 发送您的需求、页面是否有图片及网站类型，不会自动发送已有页面文字、名称、图片内容或稿件。请只使用虚构信息。API 可能收费，服务商可能保留数据；生成的建议会保存在本地测试数据库中。"

msgid "Save page changes first. AI can make mistakes or invent facts; review all output before applying and publishing."
msgstr "请先保存页面修改。AI 可能出错或编造事实，应用和发布前请审核全部内容。"

msgid "The AI manager has not enabled independent-page suggestions in this site's AI policy."
msgstr "AI 管理员尚未在本网站的 AI 策略中启用独立页面建议。"

msgid "Save an independent page before requesting suggestions."
msgstr "请先保存一个独立页面，再请求建议。"

msgid "Page to redesign"
msgstr "需要重新设计的页面"

msgid "Fictional page brief"
msgstr "虚构页面需求"

msgid "Describe the page purpose, intended audience and visual direction using fictional details."
msgstr "请用虚构信息描述页面用途、目标读者和期望视觉风格。"

msgid "Send this brief and the listed page context to OpenAI for one request."
msgstr "同意向 OpenAI 发送本次需求及上述页面上下文。"

msgid "Request page suggestions"
msgstr "请求页面建议"

msgid "My page suggestion requests"
msgstr "我的页面建议请求"

msgid "No page suggestion requests yet."
msgstr "暂无页面建议请求。"

msgid "This policy covers OpenAI metadata, site design, module arrangement and independent-page suggestions. It does not enable other AI providers or manuscript file processing."
msgstr "本策略覆盖 OpenAI 元数据、网站设计、模块编排及独立页面建议；不会启用其他 AI 服务商或稿件文件处理。"

msgid "This separate policy covers publisher portal visual design, module arrangement and independent-page suggestions. It does not change journal AI policies or grant manuscript access."
msgstr "该独立策略覆盖出版社门户视觉设计、模块编排及独立页面建议；不会改变期刊 AI 策略或授予稿件访问权限。"

msgid "Reviewed content applied at that time"
msgstr "当时应用的已审核内容"

msgid "Each suggested text is limited to 2,500 characters. You can expand the page in the editor after applying."
msgstr "每条建议正文最多 2,500 个字符；应用后可在页面编辑器中继续扩充。"

msgid "Text"
msgstr "文本"

msgid "Image and text"
msgstr "图文"

msgid "Highlight"
msgstr "重点提示"

msgid "Quotation"
msgstr "引文"

msgid "Link"
msgstr "链接"

msgid "Block style"
msgstr "区块样式"

msgid "Choose a style"
msgstr "选择样式"

msgid "Block heading"
msgstr "区块标题"

msgid "Block text"
msgstr "区块正文"

msgid "Link label"
msgstr "链接文字"

msgid "Link URL"
msgstr "链接地址"

msgid "Use an HTTPS address or a site path beginning with / ."
msgstr "请输入 HTTPS 地址，或以 / 开头的站内路径。"

msgid "Show this block when the page is published"
msgstr "页面发布后显示此区块"

msgid "Block image"
msgstr "区块图片"

msgid "Block image description"
msgstr "区块图片描述"

msgid "Block image display"
msgstr "区块图片显示方式"

msgid "Block image focus"
msgstr "区块图片焦点"

msgid "Enter both a link label and URL."
msgstr "请同时填写链接文字和链接地址。"

msgid "Use a valid HTTPS address or local site path."
msgstr "请输入有效的 HTTPS 地址或站内路径。"

msgid "Add text, an image or a link to this block."
msgstr "请为此区块添加文字、图片或链接。"

msgid "Check the content and links in each block."
msgstr "请检查每个区块的内容和链接。"

msgid "The page editor is out of date; reload the page."
msgstr "页面编辑器已过期，请重新加载。"

msgid "Content blocks saved to the draft. Preview the page before publishing."
msgstr "内容区块已保存到草稿，请在发布前预览页面。"

msgid "Content block"
msgstr "内容区块"

msgid "Delete this block"
msgstr "删除此区块"

msgid "Page content blocks"
msgstr "页面内容区块"

msgid "Build this page with text, images, highlights, quotations and links. Add as many blocks as you need within the prototype limit, then reorder, hide or delete them."
msgstr "使用文字、图片、重点提示、引文和链接构建页面。可在原型数量限制内添加区块，并调整顺序、隐藏或删除。"

msgid "Upload images in the site's image library first. Each block can use one image and needs an accessible description. Up to 20 blocks are supported per page in this prototype."
msgstr "请先将图片上传至网站图片库。每个区块可使用一张图片，需提供无障碍描述；此原型每页最多支持 20 个区块。"

msgid "Use the handles, arrow buttons or order numbers. Blocks remain in the draft until the site is published. Hidden blocks and their images stay private unless the same image is published elsewhere."
msgstr "使用拖动手柄、箭头按钮或顺序编号调整排列。区块在网站发布前保留在草稿中。隐藏的区块及其图片不会公开，除非同一图片在其他公开位置使用。"

msgid "Block order updated."
msgstr "区块顺序已更新。"

msgid "Maximum block count reached. Save deletions before adding more."
msgstr "已达到区块数量上限，请先保存删除操作。"

msgid "Add block"
msgstr "添加区块"

msgid "Save content blocks"
msgstr "保存内容区块"

msgid "Without JavaScript, use the empty block and order numbers above; save before adding another block."
msgstr "未启用 JavaScript 时，可使用上方空白区块和顺序编号；保存后再添加下一区块。"

msgid "Upload images in the site image library first. Each page can have a primary image and additional images in content blocks."
msgstr "请先将图片上传至网站图片库。每个页面可设置一张主图，并通过内容区块添加更多图片。"

msgid "Edit content blocks"
msgstr "编辑内容区块"

msgid "Only your brief, whether the page has a primary image, and the site type are sent to OpenAI. Existing page and block content, names, image bytes and manuscripts are not sent automatically. Use fictional information only. API use may incur charges and provider retention may apply; generated suggestions are stored in this test database."
msgstr "仅向 OpenAI 发送您输入的需求、页面是否有主图以及网站类型；不会自动发送现有页面和区块内容、名称、图片文件或稿件。请只使用虚构信息。API 可能产生费用，服务商可能保留数据；生成的建议保存在此测试数据库中。"

msgid "AI may invent or misstate facts. Check every statement, especially policies, names, indexing, fees and dates. Applying replaces this page's draft title, body and page-specific design; it preserves its URL, image, content blocks and visibility. Publishing requires a separate confirmation."
msgstr "AI 可能虚构或误述事实。请核实每一项内容，尤其是政策、名称、收录、费用和日期。应用将替换此页面草稿的标题、正文及页面设计，但保留网址、图片、内容区块和可见状态。发布需要另行确认。"

msgid "Enable AI page-block suggestions"
msgstr "启用 AI 页面区块建议"

msgid "AI page-block suggestions"
msgstr "AI 页面区块建议"

msgid "Add a heading or text to this block."
msgstr "请为区块填写标题或正文。"

msgid "Keep at least one valid suggested block."
msgstr "请至少保留一个有效的建议区块。"

msgid "AI page-block suggestions are not enabled for this site and test environment."
msgstr "此网站或测试环境尚未启用 AI 页面区块建议。"

msgid "This page has reached the block limit. Remove a block before requesting suggestions."
msgstr "此页面已达到区块数量上限，请先删除区块再请求建议。"

msgid "The suggestion form is out of date; reload the page."
msgstr "建议表单已过期，请重新加载页面。"

msgid "The suggested blocks are invalid or exceed the page limit."
msgstr "建议区块无效或超过页面数量上限。"

msgid "Suggested blocks added to the draft. Edit them before publishing."
msgstr "建议区块已添加至草稿，请在发布前编辑。"

msgid "Back to page content blocks"
msgstr "返回页面内容区块"

msgid "Reviewed blocks applied at that time"
msgstr "当时应用的已审核区块"

msgid "AI may invent facts. Check every statement, particularly names, policies, indexing and fees. Suggestions add new blocks after existing ones; they never replace existing content. Images and links must be added manually after applying."
msgstr "AI 可能虚构事实。请核对每项内容，尤其是名称、政策、收录和费用。建议会追加到现有区块之后，不会替换已有内容。图片和链接需在应用后手动添加。"

msgid "Target page"
msgstr "目标页面"

msgid "Edit the proposed blocks, enter order numbers or mark blocks for removal, then preview them on the page."
msgstr "请编辑建议区块、填写顺序编号或勾选移除，然后在页面中预览。"

msgid "Suggested block"
msgstr "建议区块"

msgid "Remove this suggestion"
msgstr "移除该建议"

msgid "Preview reviewed blocks"
msgstr "预览已审核区块"

msgid "Private AI block preview. Check the proposed content before adding it to the draft."
msgstr "AI 区块的私密预览。请检查建议内容，再将其添加到草稿。"

msgid "Add these reviewed blocks to the draft page."
msgstr "将这些已审核区块添加到页面草稿。"

msgid "Add to draft"
msgstr "添加到草稿"

msgid "Describe what you want this page to communicate. AI can propose new editable blocks. Existing blocks remain unchanged and new blocks are appended after review."
msgstr "描述页面要传达的内容，AI 可以提出可编辑的新区块。已有区块保持不变，新区块经审核后追加。"

msgid "Only your brief, the site type and the number of available block slots are sent to OpenAI. Existing page and block text, names, images, links and manuscripts are not sent automatically. Use fictional information only. API use may incur charges and provider retention may apply; generated suggestions are stored in this test database."
msgstr "仅向 OpenAI 发送您的需求、网站类型和可添加区块数量。现有页面与区块正文、名称、图片、链接和稿件不会自动发送。请只使用虚构信息。API 可能产生费用，服务商可能保留数据；生成的建议保存在此测试数据库中。"

msgid "AI suggestions may contain errors or invented facts. Images and links are not generated; add them manually after applying. Save your edits first."
msgstr "AI 建议可能包含错误或虚构事实。图片和链接不会自动生成，应用后可手动添加。请先保存当前编辑。"

msgid "The AI manager has not enabled page-block suggestions in this site's AI policy."
msgstr "AI 管理员尚未在此网站的 AI 策略中启用页面区块建议。"

msgid "Fictional block design brief"
msgstr "虚构区块设计需求"

msgid "Describe the page audience, content goals and visual direction using fictional details."
msgstr "请使用虚构信息描述页面读者、内容目标和期望视觉方向。"

msgid "Send this brief and the listed context to OpenAI for one request."
msgstr "同意向 OpenAI 发送本次需求和上述上下文。"

msgid "Request block suggestions"
msgstr "请求区块建议"

msgid "My block suggestion requests"
msgstr "我的区块建议请求"

msgid "No block suggestion requests yet."
msgstr "暂无区块建议请求。"

msgid "This policy covers OpenAI metadata, site design, module arrangement, independent-page and page-block suggestions. It does not enable other AI providers or manuscript file processing."
msgstr "本策略覆盖 OpenAI 元数据、网站设计、模块编排、独立页面及页面区块建议；不会启用其他 AI 服务商或稿件文件处理。"

msgid "This separate policy covers publisher portal visual design, module arrangement, independent-page and page-block suggestions. It does not change journal AI policies or grant manuscript access."
msgstr "该独立策略覆盖出版社门户视觉设计、模块编排、独立页面及页面区块建议；不会改变期刊 AI 策略或授予稿件访问权限。"

msgid "Return to edit reviewed blocks"
msgstr "返回修改已审核区块"

msgid "Customise this block's visual design"
msgstr "自定义此区块的视觉设计"

msgid "Block image layout"
msgstr "区块图文布局"

msgid "Block width (%)"
msgstr "区块宽度（%）"

msgid "Block background colour"
msgstr "区块背景颜色"

msgid "Block accent colour"
msgstr "区块强调颜色"

msgid "Block text alignment"
msgstr "区块文字对齐方式"

msgid "Inner spacing (px)"
msgstr "内边距（像素）"

msgid "Corner radius (px)"
msgstr "圆角半径（像素）"

msgid "Image and text gap (px)"
msgstr "图文间距（像素）"

msgid "Reload the block editor before changing a styled block."
msgstr "请重新加载区块编辑器后再修改带样式的区块。"

msgid "Complete every custom block design setting."
msgstr "请完整填写所有自定义区块设计设置。"

msgid "Block visual design"
msgstr "区块视觉设计"

msgid "Leave unchecked to inherit the existing style. Custom designs can use any six-digit hexadecimal colours."
msgstr "不勾选则沿用原有样式；自定义设计可输入任意六位十六进制颜色。"

msgid "Choose between 1 and 6 suggested designs."
msgstr "请选择 1 至 6 组设计建议。"

msgid "Maximum designs for this request"
msgstr "本次最多生成的设计方案数"

msgid "Choose 1–6 designs per request in this prototype. More designs may cost more and take longer."
msgstr "此原型每次可选择 1–6 组设计。方案越多，费用和等待时间可能越高。"

msgid "Only your brief, the site type, the number of available block slots and the requested number of designs are sent to OpenAI. Existing page and block text, names, images, links and manuscripts are not sent automatically. Use fictional information only. API use may incur charges and provider retention may apply; generated suggestions are stored in this test database."
msgstr "仅向 OpenAI 发送您的需求、网站类型、可添加区块数量和请求的方案数量。现有页面与区块正文、名称、图片、链接和稿件不会自动发送。请只使用虚构信息。API 可能产生费用，服务商可能保留数据；生成的建议保存在此测试数据库中。"

msgid "Describe what you want this page to communicate. AI can propose new editable blocks and visual settings. Existing blocks remain unchanged and new blocks are appended after review."
msgstr "描述页面要传达的内容，AI 可以提出可编辑的新区块及视觉设置。已有区块保持不变，新区块经审核后追加。"

msgid "Pick background colour"
msgstr "选择背景颜色"

msgid "Pick accent colour"
msgstr "选择强调颜色"

msgid "Enter hexadecimal colours directly when JavaScript is disabled."
msgstr "未启用 JavaScript 时，请直接输入十六进制颜色。"

msgid "Align to top"
msgstr "顶部对齐"

msgid "Match row height"
msgstr "同一行等高"

msgid "Grid width (1–12 columns)"
msgstr "网格宽度（1–12 列）"

msgid "Leave blank for full width. Use 6 for half, 4 for one third, or 8 for two thirds."
msgstr "留空表示占满整行；6 表示半行，4 表示三分之一行，8 表示三分之二行。"

msgid "Reload the block editor before changing grid placement."
msgstr "请重新加载区块编辑器后再修改网格位置。"

msgid "Arrange blocks side by side in a responsive grid"
msgstr "使用自适应网格并排排列区块"

msgid "Gap between blocks (px)"
msgstr "区块间距（像素）"

msgid "Alignment within a row"
msgstr "同一行的对齐方式"

msgid "Reload the page editor before changing its grid layout."
msgstr "请重新加载页面编辑器后再修改网格布局。"

msgid "Choose a valid block gap and row alignment."
msgstr "请选择有效的区块间距和行内对齐方式。"

msgid "Page block layout"
msgstr "页面区块布局"

msgid "Use 12 columns to combine blocks in flexible widths. Blocks wrap in order; on narrow screens they stack for readability."
msgstr "使用 12 列网格自由组合区块宽度。区块按顺序自动换行，在窄屏上会纵向排列以便阅读。"

msgid "Grid widths affect the preview when the saved page grid is enabled. Otherwise they are retained for later use."
msgstr "启用已保存的页面网格后，网格宽度会影响预览；未启用时，宽度设置将保留供以后使用。"

msgid "Common block widths"
msgstr "常用区块宽度"

msgid "Full width"
msgstr "整行"

msgid "One half"
msgstr "二分之一"

msgid "One third"
msgstr "三分之一"

msgid "Two thirds"
msgstr "三分之二"

msgid "One quarter"
msgstr "四分之一"

msgid "When the grid is enabled, this is a percentage of the block's assigned grid area."
msgstr "启用网格时，该比例以区块所占的网格区域为基准。"

msgid "Enable AI page-layout suggestions"
msgstr "启用 AI 页面布局建议"

msgid "AI page-layout suggestions"
msgstr "AI 页面布局建议"

msgid "Ask AI to suggest new arrangements for the blocks already saved on this page. Review and adjust block order, widths, spacing and alignment before previewing and applying a layout to the draft."
msgstr "请 AI 为此页面已保存的区块建议新的排列方式。您可以先调整区块顺序、宽度、间距和对齐方式，再预览并应用到草稿。"

msgid "OpenAI receives your fictional brief and each block's temporary identifier, type, position, visibility, image presence and grid width. Page and block text, links, names, image identifiers and image bytes are not sent automatically. Hidden blocks are included as structural descriptors. Use fictional information only; API charges and provider retention may apply."
msgstr "OpenAI 会收到您输入的虚构设计要求，以及每个区块的临时标识、类型、位置、可见状态、是否包含图片和网格宽度。页面及区块文字、链接、名称、图片标识和图片内容不会自动发送。隐藏区块的结构信息也会包含在内。请仅使用虚构信息；API 可能收费，服务商可能保留数据。"

msgid "All existing blocks, including hidden ones, are retained. AI changes layout only. Save your edits first; publishing remains a separate action."
msgstr "所有现有区块（包括隐藏区块）都会保留。AI 仅调整布局。请先保存您的编辑；发布仍需单独操作。"

msgid "The AI manager has not enabled page-layout suggestions in this site's AI policy."
msgstr "AI 管理员尚未在本站的 AI 策略中启用页面布局建议。"

msgid "Add at least one valid block before requesting a layout."
msgstr "请求布局建议前，请至少添加一个有效区块。"

msgid "Fictional layout brief"
msgstr "虚构页面布局要求"

msgid "Describe the audience and visual direction using fictional details."
msgstr "请使用虚构信息描述目标读者和视觉方向。"

msgid "Request layout suggestions"
msgstr "获取布局建议"

msgid "My layout suggestion requests"
msgstr "我的布局建议请求"

msgid "No layout suggestion requests yet."
msgstr "尚无布局建议请求。"

msgid "AI page-layout suggestions are not enabled for this site and test environment."
msgstr "本站或测试环境尚未启用 AI 页面布局建议。"

msgid "Keep each block once and use a different order number for each block."
msgstr "请确保每个区块只出现一次，并为每个区块使用不同的顺序编号。"

msgid "This layout was applied to the draft."
msgstr "此布局已应用到草稿。"

msgid "The AI policy changed; request new suggestions after the policy is enabled."
msgstr "AI 策略已更改；请在启用策略后重新获取建议。"

msgid "The AI service was unavailable or returned an invalid response."
msgstr "AI 服务暂不可用，或返回了无效结果。"

msgid "Adjust each block's order and grid width. Every original block is retained, including hidden blocks. Preview before applying."
msgstr "调整每个区块的顺序和网格宽度。所有原有区块（包括隐藏区块）都会保留。请在应用前预览。"

msgid "Preview reviewed layout"
msgstr "预览已调整的布局"

msgid "The draft or AI policy changed; request new suggestions."
msgstr "草稿或 AI 策略已更改，请重新获取建议。"

msgid "The reviewed layout is invalid or expired."
msgstr "已审核的布局无效或已过期。"

msgid "Private AI layout preview. This arrangement is not applied or published; hidden blocks remain hidden."
msgstr "AI 布局私人预览。此方案尚未应用或发布；隐藏区块仍保持隐藏。"

msgid "Apply this reviewed layout to the draft page."
msgstr "将已审核的布局应用到页面草稿。"

msgid "Apply layout to draft"
msgstr "将布局应用到草稿"

msgid "Return to edit this layout"
msgstr "返回修改此布局"

msgid "The reviewed layout was applied to the draft. Publishing remains separate."
msgstr "已将审核后的布局应用到草稿。发布仍需单独操作。"

msgid "Live layout sketch"
msgstr "实时布局草图"

msgid "This sketch shows visible blocks on desktop in their relative widths. Hidden blocks stay hidden. Open the full preview to check the page and mobile layout."
msgstr "草图展示电脑端可见区块的相对宽度；隐藏区块保持隐藏。请打开完整预览检查页面和手机端布局。"

msgid "Enable JavaScript to see the sketch."
msgstr "启用 JavaScript 后可查看布局草图。"

msgid "No visible blocks in this sketch."
msgstr "此草图没有可见区块。"

msgid "Page-layout suggestions have their own independent switch below."
msgstr "页面布局建议使用下方单独的开关。"

msgid "Drag blocks in the sketch to reorder them, or use the move buttons below."
msgstr "拖动草图中的区块即可调整顺序，也可以使用下方的移动按钮。"

msgid "Author name"
msgstr "作者姓名"

msgid "Affiliation"
msgstr "作者单位"

msgid "Email address"
msgstr "电子邮箱"

msgid "ORCID iD (optional)"
msgstr "ORCID iD（可选）"

msgid "Enter an ORCID iD or its https://orcid.org/ address. It is not authenticated here."
msgstr "请输入 ORCID iD 或其 https://orcid.org/ 地址；此处不会核验身份。"

msgid "Corresponding author"
msgstr "通讯作者"

msgid "Enter a correctly formatted ORCID iD with a valid check digit."
msgstr "请输入格式和校验位均有效的 ORCID iD。"

msgid "Check the author details. Email addresses and ORCID iDs must not be repeated."
msgstr "请检查作者信息；电子邮箱和 ORCID iD 不能重复。"

msgid "The author list is locked after the initial submission."
msgstr "初次投稿后，作者列表将锁定。"

msgid "The saved author list is invalid; contact the local administrator."
msgstr "已保存的作者信息无效，请联系本地管理员。"

msgid "The author editor is out of date; reload the page."
msgstr "作者编辑页面已过期，请重新加载。"

msgid "The draft or author list changed; reload the page."
msgstr "草稿或作者列表已发生变化，请重新加载。"

msgid "Author details saved to the draft."
msgstr "作者信息已保存到草稿。"

msgid "Add a corresponding author and email for each corresponding author before submitting."
msgstr "提交前请指定通讯作者，并填写每位通讯作者的电子邮箱。"

msgid "Author details"
msgstr "作者信息"

msgid "Remove this author"
msgstr "删除此作者"

msgid "Submission authors"
msgstr "投稿作者"

msgid "Add authors in their publication order, including yourself where appropriate. You may mark more than one corresponding author."
msgstr "按发表顺序填写作者，并在适用时包括您自己。可以标记多位通讯作者。"

msgid "Use fictional test information only. Authors listed here do not receive accounts, invitations or manuscript access. These details are visible to the submitting author and assigned editors, not on the reviewer page."
msgstr "请仅使用虚构测试信息。此处列出的作者不会自动获得账户、邀请或稿件访问权限。投稿作者与指定编辑可以查看这些信息，审稿页面不显示此列表。"

msgid "The author list is optional in this prototype. If you add authors, designate at least one corresponding author and provide an email for every corresponding author before submitting. ORCID is optional and is not identity verification."
msgstr "当前原型中的作者列表为选填。如已添加作者，提交前须至少指定一位通讯作者，并为每位通讯作者填写邮箱。ORCID 为选填，此处不会核验身份。"

msgid "The list is locked after initial submission. It is not automatically copied to production or checked against editor and reviewer accounts; assess conflicts separately."
msgstr "初次投稿后作者列表将锁定。名单不会自动传入制作流程，也不会自动与编辑和审稿人账户比对；请单独核查利益冲突。"

msgid "Author order updated."
msgstr "作者顺序已更新。"

msgid "Maximum author count reached. Save deletions before adding more."
msgstr "已达到作者数量上限。请先保存删除操作，再添加作者。"

msgid "Add another author"
msgstr "添加作者"

msgid "Save author details"
msgstr "保存作者信息"

msgid "Without JavaScript, complete the blank author form and save before adding another author."
msgstr "如果未启用 JavaScript，请填写空白作者表单并保存，然后继续添加作者。"

msgid "Edit author details"
msgstr "编辑作者信息"

msgid "No author details have been added to this draft."
msgstr "尚未为这篇草稿添加作者信息。"

msgid "This list does not grant account access or establish author consent. It is not shown on the reviewer page; conflict checks remain manual."
