msgid "AI design workspace"
msgstr "AI 设计工作台"

msgid "DESIGN STUDIO"
msgstr "设计工作室"

msgid "Find your website design requests and continue reviewing their suggestions."
msgstr "查找您的网站设计请求，继续审核相应建议。"

msgid "PRIVATE DESIGN WORKSPACE"
msgstr "私人设计工作区"

msgid "Fictional test data only. This workspace shows your own requests for this site; viewing it does not call AI or publish changes."
msgstr "仅使用虚构测试数据。此工作台显示您为该网站提交的请求；查看不会调用 AI 或发布更改。"

msgid "Design request totals"
msgstr "设计请求统计"

msgid "All requests"
msgstr "全部请求"

msgid "Your design history"
msgstr "您的设计记录"

msgid "Responses received"
msgstr "已收到的回复"

msgid "Applied"
msgstr "已应用"

msgid "Previously applied to a draft"
msgstr "曾应用到草稿"

msgid "YOUR DESIGN REQUESTS"
msgstr "您的设计请求"

msgid "Explore your ideas"
msgstr "浏览您的创意"

msgid "Filter by design task or response status."
msgstr "按设计任务或回复状态筛选。"

msgid "Continue designing"
msgstr "继续设计"

msgid "Design task"
msgstr "设计任务"

msgid "All tasks"
msgstr "全部任务"

msgid "Independent page"
msgstr "独立页面"

msgid "Page blocks"
msgstr "页面内容区块"

msgid "Other design request"
msgstr "其他设计请求"

msgid "Response status"
msgstr "回复状态"

msgid "Show requests"
msgstr "显示请求"

msgid "A matching draft alone does not guarantee that a suggestion can be used. Open the request to review its current conditions."
msgstr "草稿匹配本身并不能保证建议可用。请打开请求，查看当前条件。"

msgid "AI DESIGN REQUEST"
msgstr "AI 设计请求"

msgid "Draft revision"
msgstr "草稿版本"

msgid "Applied to draft revision"
msgstr "已应用到草稿版本"

msgid "Same draft snapshot"
msgstr "草稿快照未变"

msgid "Draft has changed since this request"
msgstr "请求之后草稿已更改"

msgid "This request type has no review page."
msgstr "此类请求暂无审核页面。"

msgid "No design requests match these filters."
msgstr "没有符合筛选条件的设计请求。"

msgid "Design request pages"
msgstr "设计请求分页"

msgid "Open AI design workspace"
msgstr "打开 AI 设计工作台"

msgid "Open design request"
msgstr "打开设计请求"

msgid "Visual layout designer"
msgstr "可视化布局设计器"

msgid "Open visual layout designer"
msgstr "打开可视化布局设计器"

msgid "Arrange your page blocks and review the design before applying it to the draft."
msgstr "排列页面区块，并在应用到草稿前查看设计。"

msgid "Fictional test data only. Your layout stays private until you apply it to the draft; publishing is separate."
msgstr "仅使用虚构测试数据。布局在应用到草稿前保持私有；发布是单独的操作。"

msgid "Start with a content block"
msgstr "先添加内容区块"

msgid "Add at least one block to this page before arranging its layout."
msgstr "请先为页面添加至少一个区块，再设计布局。"

msgid "Add page content"
msgstr "添加页面内容"

msgid "LAYOUT CANVAS"
msgstr "布局画布"

msgid "Drag visible blocks to rearrange them, or use the controls on the right."
msgstr "拖动可见区块调整顺序，或使用右侧控件。"

msgid "Canvas width"
msgstr "画布宽度"

msgid "PAGE PREVIEW"
msgstr "页面预览"

msgid "A structural sketch using your saved blocks"
msgstr "基于已保存区块的结构草图"

msgid "This is a responsive 12-column grid. Blocks stack on narrow screens; hidden blocks stay in the draft and are not shown on the canvas."
msgstr "这是响应式 12 列网格。窄屏中区块纵向排列；隐藏区块保留在草稿中，但不会显示在画布上。"

msgid "Applying a layout will enable the grid for this page."
msgstr "应用布局后将为此页面启用网格。"

msgid "BLOCK CONTROLS"
msgstr "区块控件"

msgid "Arrange and resize"
msgstr "排列并调整宽度"

msgid "Set a width from 1 to 12 columns. Use the order field or move buttons for precise placement."
msgstr "设置 1 至 12 列宽度。可使用顺序字段或移动按钮精确排列。"

msgid "Ready to review?"
msgstr "准备好预览了吗？"

msgid "Preview the page with its content before applying this layout to the draft."
msgstr "将布局应用到草稿前，请先预览包含内容的页面。"

msgid "Preview page layout"
msgstr "预览页面布局"

msgid "Without JavaScript, enter order and width numbers, then preview the page."
msgstr "未启用 JavaScript 时，请输入顺序和宽度数字，然后预览页面。"

msgid "The site draft changed; reload the layout designer."
msgstr "网站草稿已更改，请重新加载布局设计器。"

msgid "Add a content block before designing the layout."
msgstr "请先添加内容区块，再设计布局。"

msgid "Private layout preview. This arrangement is not applied or published; hidden blocks remain hidden."
msgstr "私人布局预览。此排列尚未应用或发布；隐藏区块仍保持隐藏。"

msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "桌面"

msgid "Mobile"
msgstr "移动端"

msgid "Canvas display"
msgstr "画布显示"

msgid "Content"
msgstr "内容"

msgid "Outline"
msgstr "结构"

msgid "An approximate preview of saved content and styles"
msgstr "已保存内容和样式的近似预览"

msgid "The canvas shows shortened text and saved styles in a responsive 12-column grid. Open the full preview to check details. Hidden blocks remain in the draft."
msgstr "画布在响应式 12 列网格中显示简略文字和已保存的样式。请打开完整预览核对细节；隐藏区块仍保留在草稿中。"

msgid "This private review shows saved page content on the site. The AI request used your brief and block structure; reviewing makes no additional AI request."
msgstr "此私人审核在站点内显示已保存的页面内容。AI 请求使用了您填写的简介和区块结构；审核不会再次发出 AI 请求。"

msgid "Compare your suggestions"
msgstr "比较设计建议"

msgid "These miniature previews update as you adjust each option. Select a suggestion to review it."
msgstr "调整各方案时，缩略预览会同步更新。选择一个方案即可查看和调整。"

msgid "Review design"
msgstr "查看设计"

msgid "characters remaining"
msgstr "个字符可用"

msgid "Idea added. You can edit the brief before sending."
msgstr "灵感已添加。发送前您可以继续编辑设计说明。"

msgid "Idea not added: the brief would exceed 600 characters. Edit the text first."
msgstr "未添加：设计说明将超过 600 个字符。请先编辑已有文字。"

msgid "CREATIVE STARTING POINTS"
msgstr "创意起点"

msgid "Describe your vision"
msgstr "描述您的设计构想"

msgid "Add an idea or write your own. Suggestions use the available visual controls."
msgstr "添加一个灵感，或直接写下您的构想。建议使用当前可用的视觉设置。"

msgid "Create a timeless scholarly design with deep green, warm ivory, a structured masthead, and readable serif typography."
msgstr "设计经典的学术风格，使用深绿色、暖象牙白、结构清晰的刊头和易读的衬线字体。"

msgid "Scholarly heritage"
msgstr "经典学术"

msgid "Classic and authoritative"
msgstr "经典、严谨"

msgid "Add idea"
msgstr "添加灵感"

msgid "Create a warm editorial design with terracotta and cream, bold headings, a magazine-like composition, and generous spacing."
msgstr "设计温暖的编辑风格，使用陶土色和奶油色、醒目的标题、杂志式构图和宽松间距。"

msgid "Editorial warmth"
msgstr "温暖编辑风"

msgid "Expressive and welcoming"
msgstr "鲜明、亲切"

msgid "Create a contemporary research website with deep indigo, crisp typography, a confident hero, and a clear technical feel."
msgstr "设计现代研究网站，使用深靛蓝、清晰字体、鲜明的首屏和科技感。"

msgid "Digital frontier"
msgstr "数字前沿"

msgid "Modern and confident"
msgstr "现代、鲜明"

msgid "Create a calm open-research design with a light background, subtle olive accents, clear navigation, and generous white space."
msgstr "设计平和的开放研究网站，使用浅色背景、柔和的橄榄色点缀、清晰导航和充足留白。"

msgid "Open minimal"
msgstr "开放极简"

msgid "Calm and accessible"
msgstr "平和、易读"

msgid "Describe your audience, preferred colours, typography and overall feel using fictional details."
msgstr "请使用虚构信息描述目标读者、偏好的配色、字体和整体风格。"

msgid "AI visual design"
msgstr "AI 视觉设计"

msgid "Customise before applying"
msgstr "应用前自定义"

msgid "Customise AI design"
msgstr "自定义 AI 设计"

msgid "Back to AI design suggestions"
msgstr "返回 AI 设计建议"

msgid "Adjust this suggestion before applying it to the draft."
msgstr "在应用到草稿前调整此设计建议。"

msgid "Your changes remain private until you review the full preview and explicitly apply them to the draft. Publishing is separate."
msgstr "更改在您查看完整预览并明确应用到草稿前保持私有；发布需要单独操作。"

msgid "LIVE DESIGN SKETCH"
msgstr "实时设计草图"

msgid "Your visual direction"
msgstr "您的视觉方向"

msgid "A simplified sketch updates as you change colours and layout. Use the full preview to check all details."
msgstr "调整配色和布局时，简化草图会同步更新。请在完整预览中核对所有细节。"

msgid "This sketch does not show the site's full text or images."
msgstr "草图不显示网站的完整文字或图片。"

msgid "DESIGN SETTINGS"
msgstr "设计设置"

msgid "Make it your own"
msgstr "打造您的专属设计"

msgid "Choose any colours and adjust the available typography and composition."
msgstr "选择您喜欢的颜色，并调整可用的字体和构图。"

msgid "Open the complete site preview before applying your design to the draft."
msgstr "将设计应用到草稿前，请先打开完整网站预览。"

msgid "Preview customised design"
msgstr "预览自定义设计"

msgid "Private customised design preview. This design has not been applied or published."
msgstr "私人自定义设计预览。此设计尚未应用或发布。"

msgid "Apply this reviewed design to the draft."
msgstr "将已审核的设计应用到草稿。"

msgid "Apply design to draft"
msgstr "将设计应用到草稿"

msgid "Return to customise"
msgstr "返回自定义"

msgid "The reviewed design is invalid or expired."
msgstr "已审核的设计无效或已过期。"

msgid "The site draft changed or this suggestion was already applied."
msgstr "网站草稿已变化，或该建议已被应用。"

msgid "DESIGN REVIEW"
msgstr "设计审核"

msgid "Responsive website preview"
msgstr "响应式网站预览"

msgid "Review the same design at different screen widths. Links are disabled in this preview."
msgstr "在不同屏幕宽度下查看同一设计。此预览中的链接已禁用。"

msgid "Preview screen width"
msgstr "预览屏幕宽度"

msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "平板电脑"

msgid "Scroll inside the preview to see the full page; wider views may require horizontal scrolling."
msgstr "在预览内滚动可查看完整页面；较宽的视图可能需要横向滚动。"

msgid "Read-only website preview"
msgstr "只读网站预览"

msgid "YOUR SITE IMAGERY"
msgstr "网站图片"

msgid "Choose a hero image"
msgstr "选择主视觉图片"

msgid "Hero image"
msgstr "主视觉图片"

msgid "Select an image from this site's private library, then adjust its description and display."
msgstr "从本站私人素材库选择图片，然后调整图片描述和显示方式。"

msgid "Manage image library"
msgstr "管理图片素材库"

msgid "Use the design's feature panel"
msgstr "使用设计的特色展示面板"

msgid "No images uploaded yet. Add a fictional image to the library first."
msgstr "尚未上传图片，请先在素材库中添加虚构测试图片。"

msgid "Images stay in your site's library; reviewing this design does not send images to an AI provider."
msgstr "图片保留在本站素材库中；审核此设计不会向 AI 服务商发送图片。"

msgid "Provide a description for the selected hero image."
msgstr "请为所选主视觉图片填写描述。"

msgid "The sketch shows the selected hero image, but not the site's full text or other images."
msgstr "草图显示所选主视觉图片，但不显示网站完整文字或其他图片。"

msgid "To add images, use Upload to library only before editing. Opening the library leaves this page without saving your current adjustments."
msgstr "如需添加图片，请在编辑前使用“仅上传到素材库”。打开素材库会离开本页，当前调整不会保存。"
